{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "914d674e176a0529f7ef676cd1901856976ed450e503a37d069575720941f929", "ja": "彼女が過ごす大切な日々", "zh": "她度过的珍贵日常", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e9ec499b1798c4925719056845b0d2223e5d9ead19cf850c23cc746f4a173dee", "ja": "入れ替わり初日。麗花は志保の代わりを務め\nる中で、志保が家族との普通の生活のために\n重ねている努力を知り感心する。そして劇場\nでの娘の様子を心配する志保の母を安心させ\nつつ、公演に招待するのだった。", "zh": "互换后的第一天。丽花在替志保\n完成工作的过程中，得知志保为了\n和家人过上平凡的生活一直付出的\n努力，不禁对她心生敬意。随后，\n她安慰了担心女儿在剧场表现的志保母亲，并邀请她前来看公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "0cb12c7e94fbbfc110e5d86650944f02716586f231e2dde2cb0dd7dd499de269", "ja": "―入れ替わり当日　side麗花―", "zh": "―互换当天　side丽花―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "3ceb0429fddb8d2a0fce19597792bad9d6d47bc57fc2c886578119cc2d9036d4", "ja": "ただいま～！　志保ちゃん家に無事到着♪\nりっくんも、お帰りなさい！", "zh": "我回来啦～！顺利到达志保家♪\n小陆，你也回来啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1002_riku", "source_sha256": "093f4baab361012d2b33017f240f6d0ddf6ef26f3dfbb8c4115092e577b2fae3", "ja": "うん、ただいま！　ねえねえ、れいかおねえちゃん、\nなにしてあそぶ？", "zh": "嗯，我回来了！我说我说，丽花姐姐，\n我们要玩什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "3202faf89366291dc98c5598ae05c5ca43b0ebbfd2e576d1b1b2cc1536a214f2", "ja": "ごめんね、いつもだったらすぐ遊ぶんだけど、\n今の私は志保ちゃんなんだ。えっと、確か最初は……。", "zh": "对不起呀，平时我肯定会马上陪你玩，不过现在的我是志保。呃，我记得第一件事是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "a5cde6c126404e8b66bf3c8a3b253fd27555eb9e4da44542e640ee63e1182463", "ja": "『帰ったら、まずは洗濯物を取り込んでください。\nそれから夕飯づくりに取り掛かって……』", "zh": "“回家后，请先把晾着的衣服收进来。\n然后开始准备晚饭……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "2c6af608b6c00ecb332f6814787b819291d3761275e730c5c8ca5673fce3facf", "ja": "りっくん！　私も志保ちゃんとして頑張るから、\nお手伝い、お願いできるかな？", "zh": "里克！我也会作为志保努力的，所以，能请你帮个忙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1006_riku", "source_sha256": "ddac58ecca58a756196f8a0c439892fdb0b8cadba54ac1467a6bce601de8678a", "ja": "うん。ぼく、いつもおねえちゃんのお手伝い\nしてるんだよ。", "zh": "嗯。我平时总是在\n帮姐姐的忙哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "5306a689f3bf93c3a2626cda99b1a28c27a146dd8fd9f250092e15bc8c1fbf7e", "ja": "わぁ、すごいね！　よーし、じゃあ一緒に頑張ろう！\nえいえい、おー！", "zh": "哇，真厉害呢！好～，那我们一起加油吧！\n嘿呀，嘿呀，冲——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "e95ece5684ccd62dbe642bb1f7994ebd3825af52f667c374e57a19c02379c260", "ja": "むむむ……むむっ……\nはぁ……！", "zh": "唔唔唔……唔唔……\n呼……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "4699dacc8c5c9eee03bc32093fac1b230f81add495d95d9956fe0df44b624b3a", "ja": "りっくん、アイロンがけって難しいんだね～。", "zh": "小陆，烫衣服好难呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1010_riku", "source_sha256": "43e8da2cecf5738067aa5b0185b145e1bd6052e7e176d78f2b424416999bb4cc", "ja": "れいかおねえちゃん、\nアイロン、やったことないの？", "zh": "丽花姐姐，\n你没用过熨斗吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "27d3243e4cd93a9ee1fb0964a78e4428e76b44457d4e1203c071c88b98b0aa80", "ja": "えへへ、実はあんまりないんだ。\n志保ちゃんにやり方、聞いた方がいいかなぁ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，其实我不太会。要不要去问志保该怎么做呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1012_riku", "source_sha256": "a7031c2281d0680e17f33212d265a15adc7309eee8330320bdfc25aa6afb9c9d", "ja": "えっと、そういうときは……あ、あった！\nおねえちゃんね、いつもこの本みてたよ。", "zh": "那个，这种时候就……啊，有了！\n姐姐以前总是在看这本书。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "14b0473239d3c1d2b2527b2b0eaff686fe3e405825a65ff66b9496cc263d53fa", "ja": "どれどれ？　『子どもでもわかる家事の基本』……\nわぁ、ありがとう、りっくん！", "zh": "让我看看？《孩子也能看懂的家务基础》……\n哇，谢谢你，小陆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "ed971a19e04a75d4cc29663db7e50853b54cd9b290e805f33b25e5778bfa7055", "ja": "ふふ、アイロンのページに折り目がついてる。\n志保ちゃんもいっぱい読んだのかな？", "zh": "呵呵，熨斗的那一页还有折痕呢。\n志保也读了很多遍吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "efd710ec7ce9517edbbf5f5631c1c4cf78866535693614b2ed83793ce6feb890", "ja": "でも、今は私が志保ちゃん！\nしっかり読んで、しっかり頑張るね！", "zh": "不过，现在由我来当志保！\n我会认真阅读，也会好好加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1016_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1017_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "a37ed294f98496ad50625fafbae612601f567cbe52babcc68bcec74bd7bbc1f2", "ja": "ただいま～……。", "zh": "我回来啦～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1018_riku", "source_sha256": "e4b425ef50f5e82c6866926c999a7e1f69e26cd2d6b4a23ceef7957e4baaba4e", "ja": "あっ、おかあさん！　おかえりなさい！", "zh": "啊，妈妈！欢迎回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "e584902128f44db9c536eb300c8bc61144ba7acf73a83a3279d355508848053a", "ja": "お帰りなさい、お母さん♪", "zh": "欢迎回来，妈妈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1020_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "fab2f959f689a33c9f735ac8bd633cc5ae27dee77d77c38a71817576fbbe2f20", "ja": "あら、いらっしゃい……じゃなくて、\n今日は麗花さんが志保、でしたね？", "zh": "哎呀，欢迎光临……不对，\n今天丽花小姐是志保，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "76d95fba932de62f0a9307201b2ab4d9e0f4cc43165d978289d00968839cc764", "ja": "そうなんです！　志保ちゃんとして家事もバッチリ、\nひと通りできたと思います！　えっへん♪", "zh": "没错！作为志保，家务也做得很棒，我觉得该做的都做完了！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1022_riku", "source_sha256": "bf54a7603e81c5d58d06fa003a83a6cb48b0de1f01998abf9f1149145721454d", "ja": "あのねあのね、ぼくもお手伝いしたんだよ！", "zh": "我跟你说我跟你说，我也帮忙了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1023_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "c099effbf758c929f6311c20583cf28d1e5a969dd6fb9fd9d818b5c6d19edd9c", "ja": "ふふ、本当？　じゃあ後で、今は麗花さんになってる\nお姉ちゃんにも報告しておかないとね。", "zh": "呵呵，真的吗？那之后也得向现在变成丽花姐姐的姐姐报告一下才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "5f65fc162b92a74bd1c23b2fcc8cf925bb9910dd53e49256befdaf4106e2bf81", "ja": "もうご飯もできてますよ。よかったら、\nあたたかいうちに、みんなで一緒に食べませんか？", "zh": "饭菜也已经做好了哦。如果不介意的话，\n要不要趁热大家一起吃呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1025_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "cb283b88e92d99084f582ac23259a6425b7b510deec5575125d820506b10842b", "ja": "ええ、ありがとう。\nじゃあ、急いで着替えてきますね！", "zh": "嗯，谢谢。\n那我赶紧去换衣服！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "355f66abe6d81c163318c3b9fe15bb4d4e56b4ba93beed617e1661b7221507ec", "ja": "じゃじゃーん！　たっくさん用意したので、\n遠慮なく食べちゃってくださいね♪", "zh": "锵锵！我准备了好多好多，请别客气，尽管吃吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1027_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "55772a358e281e91cadf473c92205ee03a58f3ed93ea8f568655ee2134e02255", "ja": "こ……この料理は……？", "zh": "这……这道菜是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1028_riku", "source_sha256": "31a9ee218b1f4a4468cb7f0e178695053877228532a885b3ed2998780646ad19", "ja": "よくわかんないけど、食べたらおいしかったよ！", "zh": "虽然不太懂，但吃起来很好吃哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1029_048rei", "source_sha256": "ac08ca0bfa2e7989b4ce0c4a8d4e6ab3d1e6cbd9da636ca688780f5877ed699c", "ja": "はい！　今日は上手くいったみたいです♪", "zh": "是的！今天好像进展得很顺利♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1030_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "6024514171ddf086b0ea90116c64ee1f426db06588a835d71db8d14bb1cc7ea8", "ja": "そ、そう。それなら……。\n……まぁ！　本当、美味しい！", "zh": "是、是这样啊。那样的话……  \n……哎呀！真的好好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "593b24e31b630ccfc93fc1e2982dd54a5a0d6b77499e470eb4e2e14292452ccd", "ja": "はいっ、りっくんもお代わりどうぞ♪", "zh": "好的，陆君，再来一份吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1032_riku", "source_sha256": "14dca0de20624c8724ef0f56f90733cfecadc7930b6d7b2796e33820ed31cb4d", "ja": "うんっ！\nあ……ふつうのにんじんだ……。", "zh": "嗯！\n啊……是普通的胡萝卜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1033_048rei", "source_sha256": "118e86e8bc0225206561e6f3e43ee3d656bfcc9d8da8c934627d1186b2c890dd", "ja": "普通のにんじん？", "zh": "普通的胡萝卜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1034_riku", "source_sha256": "9f5adc5520624e697337de720c518de03c6d4fdc644ba99fd2125dfb03e2caf6", "ja": "おねえちゃんのにんじんは、\nお花とか、ネコの形なの。", "zh": "姐姐的胡萝卜是花朵或者猫咪的形状。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1035_048rei", "source_sha256": "a7c965c9aaa48da6054b7f1d4d70df98d380eb74c8b38e4eae8e74423614013a", "ja": "えっ、そんなにんじんがあるの！？", "zh": "诶，还有那种形状的胡萝卜吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1036_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "ed4fde13d1d06d1b3d1157548e380b2a143f32fc4422fcfae5ca5a417ea43908", "ja": "ふふ、いつもは志保が、型抜きしてくれてるんです。\n陸が食べやすいようにって。", "zh": "呵呵，平时都是志保帮忙把食物压出形状的。因为这样陆吃起来会更方便。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1037_048rei", "source_sha256": "d27d4ff011265a753a4680f09bd39d23ba81f4045994c44dcefba1ec53c16f01", "ja": "そうなんですか。そこまでちゃんとして……。\nやっぱり志保ちゃんって、すごいですね。", "zh": "这样啊。居然考虑得这么周到……\n志保真是厉害呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1038_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "7ac7ffec67fffe7d0796cf0d5b0789c30ce5b8c3ecd519f4a5181084d1659b98", "ja": "そうですね、自慢の娘です。\nでも最近、ちょっと悩んでいたみたいで……。", "zh": "是啊，她是我引以为傲的女儿。  \n不过最近，她好像有点烦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1039_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "44687194394ed07fc261d723f06d38b85dd7542edf0b6ac40f9b3452d31e4038", "ja": "今度、麗花さんと二人で歌うんですよね？\nその、志保は大丈夫そうですか？", "zh": "下次要和丽花小姐两个人一起唱歌，对吧？\n那个，志保看起来没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1040_048rei", "source_sha256": "b83e6013a57a54b0ca9cbda6563b97ffc610187295f139116fbb802e17c4fcbd", "ja": "もちろんバッチリですよ！\n劇場にとっても、自慢の志保ちゃんです♪", "zh": "当然没问题！\n志保可是剧场引以为傲的志保哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_04_1041_048rei", "source_sha256": "5b90ec95a3a1bdc0048f6fc979b13dab64aeea343b75f506c48ddae0b5ea8b05", "ja": "二人で絶対素敵なステージにしますから……、\nよかったら観に来てくださいね。お母さん♪", "zh": "我们两个人一定会把舞台办得精彩绝伦……  \n如果可以的话，请来看看吧，妈妈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
